## Value

| Dimension | Measurable value |
|---|---|
| Functional | project creation and selection produce one coherent, immediately usable workspace |
| Security | grants and project creation use one action model and one normalized grant interpretation |
| Correctness | concurrent creates cannot lose grants or leak raw uniqueness failures |
| User | selected workspace and Canvas editability no longer depend on contradictory server/browser claims |
| Performance | project listing removes N+1; Graph Draft avoids repeated authentication/grant reads |
| Developer | one contract and one authority replace repeated DTOs, constants and grant mappers |
| Architecture | project, grant, selection and authoring responsibilities become explicit without new subsystems |
