## Explicitly insufficient

- moving the three grant JSON interfaces into a fourth file while keeping three interpretations;
- adding another project/workspace registry or role matrix;
- preserving `project:create` as a raw OAuth scope inside the repository;
- catching unique violations without testing concurrent replay and grant preservation;
- sorting `availableWorkspaces` while continuing to call browser-selected state server-owned;
- implementing a server preference without a current product need;
- deleting read-only Graph Draft behavior merely to reduce files;
- keeping two schema constants synchronized by tests;
- treating only the active Canvas as authoritative in one path and all canvases in another;
